* LT6654-1.25 Voltage Reference Circuit
V1 IN 0 5V
C1 IN 0 1uF
C2 OUT 0 1uF

* LT6654-1.25 (Using the standard LTspice A-grade, HS6 package model)
X1 IN 0 OUT LT6654AHS6-1.25

* Optional light load to ensure stable operation
R1 OUT 0 100k

* Simulation directive to measure DC settled output
.tran 2m

.end
